for (const token of tokens) { console.log(`${token.surface}\t${token.details.join(",")}`);
} In this pipeline: unicode_normalize converts full-width characters to half-width (NFKC normalization) japanese_iteration_mark resolves iteration marks japanese_base_form converts inflected tokens to base form japanese_stop_tags removes particles, auxiliary verbs, and punctuation lowercase normalizes alphabetic characters to lowercase

