); Property Type Default Description kanji_penalty_length_threshold number 2 Length threshold for kanji compound splitting kanji_penalty_length_penalty number 3000 Penalty cost for kanji compounds exceeding threshold other_penalty_length_threshold number 7 Length threshold for non-kanji compound splitting other_penalty_length_penalty number 1700 Penalty cost for non-kanji compounds exceeding threshold Pass it to Mode.decompose() , and the mode to setMode() or to the Tokenizer constructor . The Penalty is read, not consumed, so the same one can be passed again. Without length penalties, decompose mode keeps long words whole, as normal mode does: import { Mode, Penalty, Tokenizer, TokenizerBuilder, loadDictionary } from 'lindera-wasm-ipadic'; const text = "関西国際空港限定トートバッグ";
